{
  "text": " The parcel was waiting at the wrong door. Nora checked the label, then looked across the hall. The number matched the apartment opposite. She carried the parcel over and knocked. For a moment, nothing happened. Then the door opened, and an anxious neighbour smiled. He had been waiting all morning. Nora handed it over and stepped back. A small mistake had taken only a minute to fix. When she returned home, the hallway was quiet again. This time, the parcel was exactly where it belonged.",
